    "notes": "Large-ensemble Mingus album with Sy Johnson and Alan Raph orchestrations/conducting. Core orchestra confirmed by Jazzdisco sessionography across four NYC sessions (Sep 23, Sep 30, Oct 1, Nov 18 1971). AllMusic credits list additional musicians (Eddie Bert, Marvin Stamm, Bucky Pizzarelli, etc.) that are not corroborated by Jazzdisco or the 1992 liner notes; these are marked epistemic 'unk' and excluded from track-level assignments. Instruments 'reeds', 'tuba', and 'tenor horn' fall outside the standard taxonomy and are flagged in individual notes. Teo Macero is producer and conductor; his saxophone track coverage is unspecified. Studio not listed by any source."
  },
  "ballot": {
    "album": "Charles Mingus \u2014 Let My Children Hear Music (1972)",
    "scope_check": {
      "in_window": true,
      "boundary_note": null
    },
    "tier": "consensus_core",
